y arise. :)", "short_description": "A competitive board game where players vote to shape their destiny. Transform caravans into 5-star hotels, collect wonders, and earn bounties for bankrupting opponents. Use airports to outmaneuver rivals, organize World Cups to multiply your rent. Can you turn your empire into a global monopoly?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Czech, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, German, Swedish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810050/b21e6ac8ed09afabb646ac9c06efa1751725c890/header.jpg?t=1787061552", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810050/d3f1001a3a1139cf710a7aa8a5400bbd7e307a47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787061552", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810050/d3f1001a3a1139cf710a7aa8a5400bbd7e307a47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787061552", "website": "https://www.fortune-avenue.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista, 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Single Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3 (1280x720)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Stéréo</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista, 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for Vulkan 1.2 (1920x1080)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi